   "relation": "dialect-of"
  }
 ],
 "level_notes": {
  "0": "mandoc (BSD) parses man and mdoc without a full roff engine; GNU groff implements them as macro packages. Files are linked from the OpenBSD src GitHub mirror.",
  "1": "mdoc(7) and man(7) on man.openbsd.org are the de facto references.",
  "3": "PLDB has no entry."
 },
